body.input:
The app: NiceSnore: a snore app with recording, score, remedy log

The spec:
product.core-flow = @home → @recording → @sleep-summary (set by a plan)
ui.lists ? how sessions and remedies look
ui.nav = Tabs: Home @home, History @history, Remedies @remedies (set by a pick)
ui.back = "‹ Back", top left (set by a pick)
ui.colors = Red is recording; snore severity green, amber, red; score 0-100, higher is worse (set by a pick)

The screens, as a tree:
@home: the first screen of NiceSnore, a snore app
  @recording: Live recording with a timer and a Stop button
    @sleep-summary: Last night: snore score, timeline of episodes, remedies tried
  @history: Past nights with their snore scores
  @remedies: Remedies tried, each with its nights and average score
    @remedy-details: One remedy: nights tried, average score before and after

